---
import CommercialLayout from '../../layouts/CommercialLayout.astro';
import BriefForm from '../../components/services/BriefForm.astro';
---

<CommercialLayout
  title="Written project brief"
  description="Send Toledo Technologies a short written brief about a workflow, custom tool, website, migration, or mobile need."
>
  <header class="page-intro brief-intro">
    <div class="commercial-shell">
      <h1 class="commercial-title">Tell us what should work.</h1><p>
        Describe the task or the problem. We’ll confirm fit, scope, and price in
        writing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="commercial-shell">
    <BriefForm heading="Your brief" compact />
  </div>
  <section class="commercial-section commercial-section--ink">
    <div class="commercial-shell">
      <div class="commercial-section__head">
        <h2>What happens after the receipt.</h2><p
          class="commercial-section__intro"
        >
          Submitting this form does not reserve capacity or start paid work.
          Toledo reviews the described result and system boundary. The written
          reply either declines the fit, asks for bounded missing information,
          recommends a separate discovery or Triage, or proposes scope, price,
          access needs, payment terms, and acceptance checks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CommercialLayout>
